      "statement": "The reviewer additionally loads directory-scoped AGENTS.md files for the diff's changed files: applicable_agents_md_paths computes every ancestor-directory AGENTS.md ordered shallowest-to-deepest so deeper instructions take precedence, and fetch_scoped_agents_md fetches them concurrently under a semaphore with each candidate failing independently.",
